Subject: [PATCH 33/63] MetalSharp: MetalFX swapchain upscaling where the back
 buffers are smaller than the window (Wine reports the window's size as the
 smallest extent)

---
 libs/vkd3d/swapchain.c | 8 ++++----
 1 file changed, 4 insertions(+), 4 deletions(-)

diff --git a/libs/vkd3d/swapchain.c b/libs/vkd3d/swapchain.c
